></span><span class="hw-c"><svg width="13" height="13" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></span></div></div><div class="hw-prose" style="animation:hwq14 linear both;animation-timeline:--hw;animation-range:contain 0% contain 100%"><p>Done. The vote is up in <b>#team</b> with three places.</p></div><div class="hw-t2"><div class="hw-user" style="animation:hwq15 linear both;animation-timeline:--hw;animation-range:contain 0% contain 100%"><p>Great. Do this every Friday at 10:00.</p></div><div class="hw-sched" style="animation:hwq16 linear both;animation-timeline:--hw;animation-range:contain 0% contain 100%"><span class="hw-zi"><svg width="13" height="13" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M13 2 3 14h9l-1 8 10-12h-9z"></path></svg></span><div><b>Agent scheduled</b><span>On schedule · Fridays · 10:00</span></div><span class="hw-on"><i></i></span></div><div class="hw-div" style="animation:hwq17 linear both;animation-timeline:--hw;animation-range:contain 0% contain 100%"><i></i><span>Friday 10:00 · ran while you were out</span><i></i></div><div class="hw-tool" style="animation:hwq18 linear both;animation-timeline:--hw;animation-range:contain 0% contain 100%"><span class="hw-ok"><svg width="10" height="10" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12.5l4.5 4.5L19 7.5"></path></svg></span><code>slack.POST_MESSAGE</code><em>#team · 10:00</em></div><div class="hw-prose" style="animation:hwq19 linear both;animation-timeline:--hw;animation-range:contain 0% contain 100%"><p>Vote posted in <b>#team</b> · 12 replies.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="hw-comp"><span class="hw-ph">Ask the agent…</span><div><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="9" y="3" width="6" height="11" rx="3"></rect><path d="M5 11a7 7 0 0 0 14 0M12 18v3"></path></svg><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m21 11-8.6 8.6a5 5 0 0 1-7-7l8.6-8.6a3.3 3.3 0 0 1 4.7 4.7l-8.6 8.6a1.7 1.7 0 0 1-2.4-2.4l8-8"></path></svg><span class="hw-send"><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 19V5M5 12l7-7 7 7"></path></svg></span></div></div></div><aside class="hw-files"><div class="hw-fh"><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 7a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h4l2 2h8a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v8a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2z"></path></svg><b>Files</b><em>agent-files</em></div><div class="hw-f"><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M14 3H7a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v14a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h10a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z"></path><path d="M14 3v5h5"></path></svg><span>AGENTS.md</span><em>2d</em></div><div class="hw-f"><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M14 3H7a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v14a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h10a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z"></path><path d="M14 3v5h5"></path></svg><span>office-address.md</span><em>5d</em></div><div class="hw-f hw-new" style="animation:hwq21 linear both;animation-timeline:--hw;animation-range:contain 0% contain 100%"><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M14 3H7a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v14a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h10a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z"></path><path d="M14 3v5h5"></path></svg><span>team-lunch-places.md</span><em>new</em></div><div class="hw-f hw-new" style="animation:hwq22 linear both;animation-timeline:--hw;animation-range:contain 0% contain 100%"><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M14 3H7a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v14a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h10a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z"></path><path d="M14 3v5h5"></path></svg><span>vote-results.csv</span><em>new</em></div></aside></div></div></div></div>
</section>
</div>

<script>
  // Browsers without CSS scroll-driven animations (Firefox): drive the same
  // keyframes from scroll progress through the tall section.
  if (!CSS.supports("animation-timeline: view()") && matchMedia("(min-width: 861px)").matches) {
    const section = document.querySelector<HTMLElement>(".sx-hiw section.hw");
    const beats = section ? [...section.querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>('[style*="animation-timeline"]')] : [];
    if (section && beats.length) {
      const DURATION = 1000;
      beats.forEach((el) => {
        el.style.animationDuration = `${DURATION}ms`;
        el.style.animationPlayState = "paused";
      });
      let frame = 0;
      const update = () => {
        frame = 0;
        const rect = section.getBoundingClientRect();
        const range = rect.height - window.innerHeight;
        const progress = range > 0 ? Math.min(1, Math.max(0, -rect.top / range)) : 1;
        beats.forEach((el) => el.getAnimations().forEach((a) => (a.currentTime = progress * DURATION)));
      };
      const schedule = () => {
        if (!frame) frame = requestAnimationFrame(update);
      };
      window.addEventListener("scroll", schedule, { passive: true });
      window.addEventListener("resize", schedule, { passive: true });
      update();
    }
  }
</script>
